 "text": "Pierce got shut in the leg and died surely is a drunk and he's locked in a mental ward because your guilt"}, {"start": 1162.82, "end": 1166.48, "text": "Drover insane Jeff lost an arm in the fire Troy"}, {"start": 1166.78, "end": 1172.7, "text": "Lost his larynx because for some dumb reason he tried to destroy a flaming troll doll by eating it"}, {"start": 1174.58, "end": 1175.86, "text": "- A lot of people."}, {"start": 1175.86, "end": 1178.98, "text": "- Life has gone to hell, Avad."}, {"start": 1178.98, "end": 1180.3, "text": "This is real."}, {"start": 1180.3, "end": 1181.9, "text": "Look at us, look at me."}, {"start": 1181.9, "end": 1185.06, "text": "- Greta, you put one wash away blue streak in your hair"}, {"start": 1185.06, "end": 1186.98, "text": "and I lost an arm."}, {"start": 1186.98, "end": 1189.18, "text": "- Exactly, life got dark."}, {"start": 1189.18, "end": 1190.34, "text": "- Not because Jeff rolled a one."}, {"start": 1190.34, "end": 1192.54, "text": "- Oh, I love how this is my fault somehow."}, {"start": 1192.54, "end": 1193.5, "text": "- It's mine."}, {"start": 1193.5, "end": 1195.02, "text": "I've run through that night over and over in my head"}, {"start": 1195.02, "end": 1196.5, "text": "and I keep coming back to one thought."}, {"start": 1196.5, "end": 1199.1, "text": "I should've caught the dye and not let you roll it."}, {"start": 1199.1, "end": 1201.22, "text": "I failed to do that and we all suffered for it."}, {"start": 1201.22, "end": 1202.54, "text": "But I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 1204.58, "end": 1209.58, "text": "- What is this? - Of all the timelines, this is clearly the darkest, which is why I propose we commit to being evil."}, {"start": 1209.58, "end": 1212.98, "text": "I made us all black-o'ties out of felt. I suggest you put 'em on until you're able to grow your own."}, {"start": 1214.78, "end": 1216.38, "text": "From now on, I'm evil, Abed."}, {"start": 1216.98, "end": 1219.78, "text": "We are the evil study group, and we have but one evil goal."}, {"start": 1220.18, "end": 1221.98, "text": "Return somehow to the prime timeline."}, {"start": 1221.98, "end": 1223.78, "text": "The one that I stopped you from rolling that dive."}, {"start": 1223.78, "end": 1226.78, "text": "Then we destroy the good versions of ourselves and reclaim our proper lives."}, {"start": 1228.18, "end": 1232.78, "text": "Evil Abed, as evil Jeff, am I allowed to pull fewer punches with you?"}, {"start": 1232.78, "end": 1236.52, "text": "Certainly. I hate you. Shut up with your sci-fi crap."}, {"start": 1236.52, "end": 1240.76, "text": "I lost my damn arm and you're making fake beards."}, {"start": 1240.76, "end": 1242.16, "text": "Go, T's."}, {"start": 1253.14, "end": 1255.6, "text": "Evil, Troy, and evil. Ah, bed."}, {"start": 1258.98, "end": 1260.14, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 1262.78, "end": 1273.7, "text": "what's wrong I guess nothing"}]}